@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Readiness: model provider configured and reachable
GET {{host}}/ready

### Safe config
GET {{host}}/api/config

### Operational diagnostics
GET {{host}}/api/diagnostics
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

### First turn
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What does policy AGENT-IDENTITY require?"
}

### Continue a conversation
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conversationId": "replace-with-id-from-first-response",
  "message": "Create a mock draft change request to align an agent to that policy."
}

### Forget in-memory conversation
DELETE {{host}}/api/conversations/replace-with-id-from-first-response

### Tool registry
GET {{host}}/api/tools
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

### Block a tool at runtime
PUT {{host}}/api/tools/LookupPolicy/state
Content-Type: application/json
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

{
  "enabled": false
}

### Re-enable a tool
PUT {{host}}/api/tools/LookupPolicy/state
Content-Type: application/json
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

{
  "enabled": true
}

### Create one-time approval for a governed write-shaped tool
POST {{host}}/api/tool-approvals
Content-Type: application/json
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

{
  "toolName": "CreateDraftChangeRequest",
  "conversationId": "replace-with-conversation-id",
  "reason": "Human approved the mock draft action."
}

### Tool audit
GET {{host}}/api/tool-audit?limit=50
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

### Run evidence summary
GET {{host}}/api/evidence/summary
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled

### Run evidence for one conversation
GET {{host}}/api/evidence/runs?conversationId=replace-with-conversation-id&limit=20
# X-Api-Key: replace-if-enabled
